        { "host": "B", "text": "Megaspeed said on Sunday that Alice Huang left the company on August 30th, 2025 and holds no role there now, and that recent media reports contain assertions not supported by verifiable evidence. Its chief executive said on Thursday that the company has cooperated with Commerce Department inspections and retained a US law firm to verify its export-control compliance." },
