        { "host": "B", "text": "Megaspeed said on Sunday that Alice Huang left the company on August 30th, 2025 and holds no role there now, and that recent media reports contain assertions not supported by verifiable evidence. Its chief executive said on Thursday that the company has cooperated with Commerce Department inspections." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "CNN also carries an Epoch AI estimate that anywhere between 290,000 to 1.6 million advanced US semiconductors were sent to China in violation of export controls last year. And it reports that Northwestern Polytechnical University, on the Entity List since 2001, bought 4 H200 chips last month for $250,000, according to procurement records published on its own website that have since been deleted." }
