        { "host": "B", "text": "And here's the caveat. The order's own text wasn't published on the LawPhil executive-orders index when we checked, so we're reading a palace briefing rather than the document. Neither report gives a signing date, a budget, or a deadline, and neither says whether the council can issue binding rules." }
