        { "host": "A", "text": "Megaspeed started out in 2015 as 7Road International, an offshoot of a Chinese gaming company, and was renamed in March 2023. Alice Huang became a director through November of that year, and CNN says that since then, trade records show Megaspeed has purchased more than $4 billion in chips and equipment from Nvidia." },
