        { "host": "A", "text": "CNN also cites an Epoch AI estimate, based on indictments and investigative reports, that anywhere between 290,000 to 1.6 million advanced US semiconductors were sent to China in violation of export controls last year. And it reports that Northwestern Polytechnical University, on the Entity List since 2001, bought 4 H200 chips last month for $250,000, according to procurement records on its own website that have since been deleted." }
