        { "host": "B", "text": "And I'm Alex." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "This is what moved in frontier AI since yesterday morning, and every figure comes from a source we opened." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "First, CNN reported that Singapore-based Megaspeed has bought more than $4 billion in chips and equipment from Nvidia since November 2023, and that renting out computing services gives Chinese companies another way to reach processors they cannot import." },
